       EESSRRCCHH  No thread with the ID _t_h_r_e_a_d could be found.

       pptthhrreeaadd__sseettsscchheeddppaarraamm() may additionally fail with  the  following  er‐
       rors:

       EEIINNVVAALL _p_o_l_i_c_y  is not a recognized policy, or _p_a_r_a_m does not make sense
              for the _p_o_l_i_c_y.

       EEPPEERRMM  The caller does not have appropriate privileges to set the spec‐
              ified scheduling policy and parameters.

